{% doc %}
  Renders the current product description as trusted rich text.

  The parent surface supplies the product context and owns the description
  block wrapper, height state and spacing. This snippet only renders the
  product-owned rich text so paragraphs, lists and links remain intact.

  @param {product} product - The product whose description should be rendered.

  @example
  {% render 'product-description', product: product %}
{% enddoc %}

{% if product != blank %}
  {% if product.description != blank %}
    {{ product.description }}
  {% endif %}
{% endif %}
